# Blender
*.blend1
*.blend2
*.blend@

# Simulation caches are regenerated by scripts/bake_cloth.py.
# The original repo shipped a .blend whose cloth cache was memory-only (totpoint 0), so it
# was never reproducible anyway. Baking from the script is deterministic; committing a
# multi-gigabyte cache is not worth it.
blendcache_*/

# Render output. The PNG frame sequence is regenerated by scripts/render.sh and runs to
# roughly 900 MB, so it stays out. The finished mp4 is the deliverable and is committed.
renders/*
!renders/ghost.mp4
*.exr

